00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:24.200
First, let's talk about what really happens when you make it illegal to buy or sell something.

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:26.740
Which is basically what Wakanda is doing when they're restricting the sale of vibranium.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:31.175
Remember, Wakanda's rulers own the whole supply

00:09:31.175 --> 00:09:33.560
And they don't allow anyone else to sell it outside the country

00:09:33.975 --> 00:09:36.925
This makes it MASSIVELY expensive.

00:09:36.925 --> 00:09:40.085
How expensive? Well, the vibranium used to construct Vision's body cost Ultron

00:09:40.085 --> 00:09:43.065
several billion dollars on the Black Market.

00:09:43.065 --> 00:09:46.165
That's right. I said billion with a 'B'

00:09:46.165 --> 00:09:49.225
Notice that I also said Black Market, also with a 'B.'

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:50.980
And also an 'M.'

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:53.440
You see, that's what actually happens when you make it illegal to buy or trade something.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.260
You get a booming black market for whatever that thing is.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:00.940
For a bizarre example, did you know that theres a black market for Botox?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.800
Botox cures everything:

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:04.420
From wrinkles to migraines.

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.560
But the pharmaceutical company who owns it,

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:08.000
Has a patent on it that lasts for decades.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:11.000
And patents work a lot like forced monopolies.

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:14.640
So only that one company, controls that one resource.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:15.700
Sound familiar?

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:21.400
And  in this case, just like in Wakanda, motivated people don't wait for the official company to produce Botox.

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:27.060
They buy Black Market Botox in Russia. Or other countries in Eastern Europe for a fraction of the price!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:31.140
Even from evidence in the movies we can see that people, and especially super villains,

