00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:48.560
And motivated people aren't just gonna sit around and wait for the next time Wakanda want to sell a dime-bag of vibranium legally

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:51.300
So, heck, I'm goin' out on the street corner

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.840
"Slip me a fiver!"

