With other substances that might be as good, if not better than their vibranium.

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:09.400
Their monopoly gets busted.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:13.040
On top of that, remember that command and control economy they're working with?

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:15.880
Well, it means that up to this point, the Wakanda rulers,

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.760
Have been responsible for providing everything for their citizens.

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:21.260
From education, to jobs, to money.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:25.880
But when vibranium isn't worth as much, the whole system falls apart.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:28.800
An entire population that's been totally isolated,

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.680
Now has to fend for itself when the country can't support them anymore.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:39.080
And even some basic high school economics and history, says that it's only a matter of time before that happens.

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:42.300
So, what does king T'Challa really have to do in this situation?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:46.520
First, maybe play a little nicer with those trade partners you're gonna need later on.

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:50.720
And for goodness' sake, don't wait for someone to develop that vibranium alternative.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:56.100
